# Mode switching

Cursor does not auto-switch Ask / Plan / Agent / Debug. After every phase gate, output:

```text
**MODE SWITCH:** <Ask|Plan|Agent|Debug> — <one-line why> — <exact phrase the captain should type next>
```

Guidance:

| Situation | Mode |
|-----------|------|
| Research, Q&A, read-only exploration | Ask |
| PRD, requirements, design, sequencing | Plan |
| Approved implementation | Agent |
| Hard runtime / flaky reproduction | Debug |

Do not continue implementing across a gate without the captain’s go-ahead in the correct mode.
